README Overview
Higher Education Teaching Portfolio — Dr. Saviour Christopher Effiong, Ph.D.

This repository houses an academic teaching dossier covering undergraduate and postgraduate (M.Ed.) instruction across educational psychology, psychometrics, educational technology, curriculum and instruction, and research methods.   
